From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DER/32-Project <der32@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:41:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] kernel: DER/32 system identity

Introduce sys/conf/der32.release as the single source of DER/32 release
metadata.  newvers.sh derives kern.ostype (uname -s = DER32) and the kernel
version string from it, and emits der32_{name,release,codename} which the
new kern_der32.c publishes as the read-only sysctl tree kern.der32.*.

kern.osrelease and the ELF identity note deliberately keep the NetBSD base
values so module loading and binary compatibility are unaffected.
---
 sys/conf/copyright     |  2 +
 sys/conf/der32.release | 12 ++++++
 sys/conf/newvers.sh    | 12 +++++-
 sys/kern/files.kern    |  1 +
 sys/kern/kern_der32.c  | 85 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 110 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 sys/conf/der32.release
 create mode 100644 sys/kern/kern_der32.c

